# بخش 24 — Acceptance Criteria

Requirement فقط زمانی Complete است که:

[ ] Admin Group can share files with Groups.

[ ] Admin Group can share folders with Groups.

[ ] Multiple Group Shares are supported.

[ ] Group list is dynamic.

[ ] Permissions are configurable.

[ ] Group Share uses proper Nextcloud Group Share semantics.

[ ] No per-user duplicate Shares are created.

[ ] Group members automatically receive Group Share access.

[ ] Removed Group members automatically lose access.

[ ] Authorized Group members can upload files.

[ ] Unauthorized Group members cannot upload.

[ ] Uploaded files receive the correct Group Tag according to the existing tagging policy.

[ ] Existing Tags are reused.

[ ] Group Admin can manage Tags belonging to their own Group.

[ ] Group Admin cannot manage Tags belonging to another Group.

[ ] Admin membership does not unintentionally bypass Cross-Group Tag isolation.

[ ] Central Permission Resolver remains authoritative.

[ ] Effective ACL remains authoritative.

[ ] Storage Isolation cannot be bypassed.

[ ] Unauthorized resources cannot be shared.

[ ] Shares can be removed.

[ ] Removing Share never deletes the underlying resource.

[ ] Audit events are generated.

[ ] Unit tests are added.

[ ] Integration tests are added.

[ ] Playwright E2E tests are added.

[ ] Cross-Group security tests are added.

[ ] Existing tests remain passing.

[ ] Documentation is updated.

[ ] No hard-coded Group list is introduced.

[ ] No direct SQL manipulation of Nextcloud internal Share tables is introduced unless explicitly justified and documented.

